--- a member of a list of functions handed where another call hands a
--- function by name: the parameter is that function's, and the member is
--- its name in the list's dispatch — refused with the fix, where it had
--- been an internal error in both modes (Rosetta Code, Deming's funnel)

fn double[x]
    x * 2

fn apply_to[f, v]
    f[v]

log[apply_to[double, 5]]
fs = [double]
log[apply_to[fs[0], 5]]
